1. create vm for standby with oracle linux installed
2.install oracle but dont create database.
3.set up network between primary and standby.
4.check the listener in primary( up or not) ,copy file listener.ora in standby and then change the host in file(sid should be the same ,dont change it)
go to $ORACLE_HOME/network/admin/
vi listener.ora
copy the listener.ora in standby (change ip )
lsnrctl start listener

5.check and change tnsnames.ora in primary and stanby.add connection name of std in primary (service_name =sid name)













































